  - [ ] Dates converted to `Date` before persisting
  - [ ] Pagination for list endpoints
  - [ ] No sensitive fields in response
  - [ ] Tests cover success and failure paths

- Auth flow change:
  - [ ] Access/refresh expiries unchanged unless explicitly required
